  "description": "The phrase 'lick my ass for an hour to get rid of the taste' is a grotesque metaphor that reinforces the stereotype of Muslims being unclean or repulsive. This is a common trope in Islamophobic rhetoric, linking religious identity to bodily disgust. This knowledge is external to the image and necessary to interpret the meme's offensive message.",
